% Scenario: text operation shape. Two Helvetica glyphs at size 12 from
% (100, 700) become one text operation whose matrix maps glyph space to
% the page and whose glyphs carry their widths, 722 and 222, as their
% displacements; the page holds one font resource. The PDF selects the
% font at size 1 with the matrix scaled by a thousand and shows the
% string with Tj.
/Helvetica findfont 12 scalefont setfont
100 700 moveto (Hi) show
showpage
